{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuaternionicElectroweak","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuaternionicElectroweak","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Quaternion","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.u1Y_isSU2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.u1Y_isSU2","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L96-L100","doc":"`U(1)_Y ⊂ SU(2)`: the hypercharge phase is a unit quaternion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.u1Y","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.u1Y","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L92-L94","doc":"The hypercharge phase `U(1)_Y` at angle `θ`: a unit quaternion in the\n`i`-plane.  Archimedean (uses `Real.cos`/`Real.sin`), hence stated over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.su2L_su2R_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.su2L_su2R_commute","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L81-L86","doc":"**`SU(2)_L × SU(2)_R` commute** — the two gauge factors act independently.\nThis is associativity of quaternion multiplication, now genuinely between the\ntwo group copies (left- vs right-multiplication). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:rem:tetraplectic-su2-gauge-reading","label":"rem:tetraplectic-su2-gauge-reading","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/tetraplectic-su2-gauge-reading.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.su2R_normSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.su2R_normSq","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L74-L79","doc":"**`SU(2)_R` acts by isometries.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.su2L_normSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.su2L_normSq","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L66-L72","doc":"**`SU(2)_L` acts by isometries** — a unit-quaternion left action preserves\nthe flavor norm, the defining property of a unitary gauge action. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.su2R","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.su2R","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L63-L64","doc":"Right gauge action `SU(2)_R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.su2L","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.su2L","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L60-L61","doc":"Left gauge action `SU(2)_L`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.one","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L55-L58","doc":"The identity quaternion lies in `SU(2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.mul","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L49-L53","doc":"Group closure: the product of two unit quaternions is a unit quaternion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.IsSU2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.IsSU2","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L46-L47","doc":"`SU(2)` realized as the unit quaternions (`normSq q = 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Tetraplectic.FlavorDoublet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Tetraplectic.FlavorDoublet","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicElectroweak.lean#L43-L44","doc":"The flavor-doublet space: a single quaternion over `R`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}